flowchart LR
    PLAY[playing at 12:34] --> SAVE[periodically save mediaId+position -> SSOT - Ch 3]
    SAVE --> SYNC[sync continue-watching - Ch 32]
    KILL[process death - Ch 8] --> RELAUNCH[relaunch]
    RELAUNCH --> RESTORE[read SSOT -> seek to 12:34]
    SYNC -.->|another device| RESUME[resume at 12:34 elsewhere]
